{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"13e Algemene Volkstelling, 31 mei 1960 - Overijssel"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:56376"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"VT1960"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"VT 1960"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek (CBS)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"V.L.  Gilissen (DANS)"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dit deel betreft de bestanden van de provincie Overijssel. De bestanden zijn ingedeeld per gemeente. Algemene bestanden betreffende de provincie Overijssel bevinden zich in de folder '_Overijssel Algemeen'De metadata per bestand (details) bevat het tabelnummer. Het bestand 'tabelnamen' geeft een overzicht van de tabelnummers met de bijbehorende tabelnamen. Dit bestand is beschikbaar gesteld als PDF document en als CSV tekstbestand."}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2013-12-16"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"historical demography"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"demographic data"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"population statistics"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"centrale bevolkingsregister"}}]},{"typeName":"notesText","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"In de collectie van de 13e Algemene Volkstelling, 31 mei 1960 bleken bij de verwerking een aantal bladen te ontbreken.\nVia het CBS zijn deze scans naderhand alsnog verzorgd. Op 31 maart 2015 is toegevoegd:\n\n-IJsselmuiden - Tabel 5, bladnummer 12 (IJsselmuiden\\110302b.jpg)\n\nVoor consistentie tussen de datasets van de Volkstelling 1960 is besloten de bladen van de schakelgebieden in een aparte folder te zetten. De volgende set bestanden is verplaatst:\n-Schakelgebied 200 (Enschede) van de folder 'Enschede' naar de folder '_Schakelgebieden\\200' (bestanden 1103470.jpg t\/m 1103506.jpg)"},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1960-05-31"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-12-16"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-12-16"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeC